---
import SectionLabel from './SectionLabel.astro';
---
<section class="section section-raised" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionLabel label="How it works" />
  </div>
  <div class="container how-grid">
    <div class="how-copy">
      <h2 id="how-title" class="h2">How the events calendar works</h2>
      <p class="intro">
        It’s a Google Form. If you can fill in a form on your phone, you can keep your what’s on up to date.
      </p>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <h3>Open the form on your phone</h3>
          <p>Save it to your home screen. It’s a simple Google Form, so there’s nothing new to learn.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Add the details</h3>
          <p>The event name, the date, the time and a line about it. Quiz, band, roast, whatever’s on.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>It appears on your site</h3>
          <p>In seconds. Past events drop off automatically, so nobody has to tidy up.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mocks demo" role="group" aria-label="Try it: add an event and watch it appear on the pub website">
      <div class="phone">
        <div class="phone-notch" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <form class="phone-screen" id="demo-form" novalidate>
          <p class="form-head">Add an event</p>
          <label class="field-mock">
            <span class="field-label">Event name</span>
            <input class="field-input" name="name" type="text" value="Curry night" maxlength="40" autocomplete="off" required />
          </label>
          <div class="field-mock two">
            <label>
              <span class="field-label">Date</span>
              <input class="field-input" name="date" type="date" required />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span class="field-label">Time</span>
              <input class="field-input" name="time" type="time" value="19:00" required />
            </label>
          </div>
          <label class="field-mock">
            <span class="field-label">A line about it</span>
            <input class="field-input" name="about" type="text" value="Two curries and a pint." maxlength="60" autocomplete="off" />
          </label>
          <button class="submit-mock" type="submit">Add event</button>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div class="site-mock">
        <div class="site-mock-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <div class="site-mock-body">
          <p class="site-mock-title">What’s on at your pub</p>
          <ul class="event-list" id="demo-list" aria-live="polite">
            <li>
              <span class="date-chip" aria-hidden="true"><b>17</b>Tue</span>
              <span class="event-text"><strong>Quiz night</strong><span>8pm. Teams of up to six. Bring a pen.</span></span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="date-chip" aria-hidden="true"><b>20</b>Fri</span>
              <span class="event-text"><strong>Live music</strong><span>9pm. Local band on stage.</span></span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="date-chip" aria-hidden="true"><b>22</b>Sun</span>
              <span class="event-text"><strong>Sunday roast</strong><span>Till 5pm. Booking advised.</span></span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mock-caption" id="demo-status">Have a go. This is a demo, nothing is saved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
